 "titulo": "He stole a weapon from the Dragon King 🐒 Sun Wukong Part 3 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "THE IRON PILLAR",
 "descripcion": "Wukong needs a weapon no one can lift. He finds it in the palace of the Dragon King, and then he goes somewhere no living thing should go.\n\n> Part 4: {when_next}.\nWhat would you erase from the Book of Life and Death?\n\nFrom Journey to the West (Xiyouji), Wu Cheng'en, 16th century, chapters 3 and 4.\n#monkeyking #sunwukong #journeytothewest #mythology #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Imagine a weapon no army could lift.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Wukong beats the demon, but every sword breaks.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "So he dives to the palace of the *Dragon King*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "A sword? Too light. A spear? Too light.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then the dragon queen mentions an iron pillar that glows.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "It once measured the sea, and it weighs *thirteen thousand pounds*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Wukong says, a little smaller. It *shrinks*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "It becomes a golden staff that obeys only him.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "It can shrink to a needle *behind his ear*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He takes dragon armor too, and never says thank you.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because his next enemy is *death*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "One night, Wukong falls asleep under a tree.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Two shadows drag his soul to the *underworld*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Your time has come, the judges say.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "They show him the *Book of Life and Death*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Wukong takes out his staff. The judges step back.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He finds his own name, and crosses it out.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then the name of *every monkey* he knows.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Now everyone complains to Heaven. Part four, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
